> > >
> > >     log | d/dp logit(p) |
> > >
> > >      = log | d/dp log(p/(1-p)) |
> > >
> > >      = log | d/dp log(p) - d/dp log(1-p) |
> > >
> > >      = log | 1/p  + 1/(1-p) |
> > >
> > >      = log ( 1/(p * (1-p)) )
> > >
> > >      = - log (p * (1 - p))
> > >
> > >      = -[log(p) + log(1-p)]
> > >
> > >      = -[log(p) + log1m(p)]
> > >
> > > I'd check my work on that derivative, too.
